w21-unused-contradiction
------------------------

This directory is a clean-room Python 3 standard-library method sketch. It is
original work for this repository and contains no third-party code, data or
weights.

Paper (method idea credited)
----------------------------
Shaohuang Wang, Jinghao Wen, Xulei Zhang and Xun Jiao.
"Dependable Long-Horizon LLM Agents: A Trajectory-Centered Empirical Study
of Where Errors Enter and Which Controls Reach Them". arXiv:2611.13254, v1,
submitted 9 Nov 2026.
https://arxiv.org/abs/2611.13254
