Code: UNVERIFIED. The abs page says "Protocol, records and scripts are
included" but gives no repository URL. No code from the authors was located
or used.

Method only: the idea that evidence against an error, already present in a
trajectory, must be acted on before a run closes, and that a flag is not a
response unless the deviated state is removed. The PDF was not read; the
authors' 95-run annotation was not reproduced. Short verbatim abstract
quotes appear only in paper_evidence.json, attributed and marked
UNVERIFIED.
